# score: La Chacona Imposible
# summary: hyper-baroque chaconne on the lamento ground — bowed string bodies, harpsichord continuo, the loom dissolves the ensemble and the ensemble survives it
# tempo: 76
# time: 3/4
# key: Dm
# bars: 62
# reverb: 1.7
# master: rms=-16

# text @b1: the ground: D-C-Bb-A, the lamento tetrachord, bowed on a cello
# text @b1: body that did not exist this morning. fifteen variations.
# text @b13: the continuo is a mandolin body pretending to be a harpsichord;
# text @b13: nobody tells it otherwise.
# text @b25: el telar breathes in: the impossible voice enters as a halo.
# text @b37: the loom takes the subject. orbit and curvature climb per event.
# text @b41: dissolution — clusters, mirrored chirality, a saw wave slides
# text @b41: its filter like a wall moving. the ground does not stop.
# text @b45: stretto. every voice at once, thirty-second cascades, the bow
# text @b45: pressed to 0.8. then the echo: the same music at a whisper.
# text @b57: coda — the ground alone, the halo breathing, tierce de picardie.

# instruments:
